                <mxCell id="n_split" value="Entity or editor?&#xa;&#xa;If an operation is driven by state the project cannot see &#8212; what is on&#xa;disk, what the workspace&#39;s palette says, what a render just produced &#8212;&#xa;it belongs on the editor. If it is a question the project answers about&#xa;itself, it stays a const query on the entity.&#xa;&#xa;That is why sanitize(), mergeFileScan() and applyProcessingResults()&#xa;live on ProjectEditor while detectStaleness() stays on ProjectItem." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="90" y="940" width="560" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_presets" value="Presets are provenance, not a flag&#xa;&#xa;An output preset is an ordinary OutputProfile the library defines in&#xa;code (models/output_presets.hpp). There is no &#39;is a preset&#39; field: a&#xa;profile is a preset because it came from the catalogue. Presets are&#xa;never serialised &#8212; the serializer strips them on save and drops&#xa;copies on load &#8212; so outputProfileId can reference one by stable id." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="720" y="940" width="580" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
